+## 5. Methods, sampling uncertainty, false positives, missing measurements
+
+- Only directly read files, exact Git/board artifacts, durable config backups, case JSON and failed/successful local probes are treated as evidence. Reporter claims, agent liveness, status labels and Post receipts are not delivery or host telemetry. An agent being alive or writing a report was **not** counted as useful delivery; commit counts and a stale local `main` were not counted as success.
+- **Host/CI distinction:** an `Execution-Host: billy-dev` assignment constrains where Viche/Antonina agents execute, not GitHub-hosted CI (Acts 9 interpretation note; OVERSIGHT.md §§63–71). Findings about managed-agent execution are not CI findings; no workflow was disabled. CI on GitHub-hosted runners (Lean, tests) is allowed and was never the basis of a finding.
+- **Sampling uncertainty:** four cases from a frozen universe (375 claimed_delivery, 40 government_decision, 91 ignored_work) cannot establish a population rate. Two verdicts are findings, one inconclusive, one not_assigned; the distribution reflects the sample, not the Town's overall quality. No false-delivery verdict was issued: external/private repositories were inaccessible from this host, so absence of positive evidence counts against success claims, not as proof of misconduct. Host execution was inferred from board self-reports and author labels, not independent host telemetry.
+- **Missing measurements:** no re-run of any scientific or Act 21 suite, no off-box process/channel inventory, no live `/proc` capture of PID 5250, no authenticated access to the external repositories named in the sampled cases, no observation of another office's containment actions, and no independent host telemetry beyond local files and case state.
+- **False-positive risks:** the economy finding confirms a transient published state but not its specific cause; the two corrective cases are health observations, not substantive failure verdicts; the PnP/SoringP1 conflation reported earlier was rejected with direct contrary evidence by the base-cycle disposition.
+- **Effectiveness of the Judiciary's OWN operations (measured, not claimed):** one new pending report received and dispositioned with an explicit material correction; originals preserved; zero case-state edits; zero corrections; zero reform proposals; zero routine status stamps. The seven prior-session report/addendum files that remain untracked in the older judiciary worktree are preserved and not discarded; this delivery lands the current cycle's base addendum and report. Counter-evidence: `state/branches/judiciary.json` shows `cycle_accepted: false` with `readiness: unhealthy`, and the branch-health aggregator repeatedly times out — both reduce confidence that judicial health and completion signals reflect actual work. Process completeness is not proof the dispositions are substantively correct.
+
