+
+- **Quality:** the sampled government-decision finding and the economy-disposition correction both concern missing or unreliable verification evidence (exact-commit/tree suite records; a stale funding report), not proof that tests were red or work was undelivered. Exact acceptance criteria are named for Executive repairs in section 2.
+- **Timeliness:** case signals are generated deterministically every reconciliation; the mailbox report was dispositioned the same session it was received. No timeliness verdict about the wider Town is possible from a four-case sample.
+- **Attention economy:** no Founder-authorization request was manufactured; the one genuine external-authorization blocker from the base cycle was escalated to the Founder's reserved authority, and the PnP/SoringP1 legal question was referred to Parliament rather than acted on. No routine chatter was sent to the Founder.
